				\begin{document}$$ {\mathrm{tRNA}}_{\mathrm{CAG}}^{\mathrm{Ser}} $$\end{document} tRNA CAG Ser . Previously reported experiments have suggested that 3–5% of the CTG-clade CUG codons are mistranslated as leucine due to mischarging of the \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
